  rarity: 1
  cardCategory: 0
  attribute: 2
  description: '"Finally got to visit that harbor specializing in Gunkan Suships
    that I''ve been curious about for a while! The premium "Shari" here is limited
    to 2000 Suships a year, and uses specially developed smooth aged rice, giving
    it extra boldness not found anywhere else. The classy atmosphere made my heart
    sing, too. The Gunkan Suship served had a perfect balance of vinegar, nigiri,
    shine, and shape, demonstrating exquisite artisanship. The owner told me, "We
    are introducing rich yet mellow scented EDO-FRONT red vinegar in the near future,"
    which I''m really looking forward to. However, I was disappointed the surrounding
    seas were a little noisy... so, giving it 4 stars with hope for improvements
    in the future."'
